# Fresh process after the origin server has exited. The named private session
# is explicitly selected, then the same search result is read from the saved
# annotation with no fetcher or resident available.
settle 5
key escape
assert snap network-offline == true
omnibar actions
type Switch to session R2 Private One
key enter
settle 8
act Search saved sources
type naïve — 東京 🐦
wait-saved-sources 600
assert snap saved-sources-status == Ready
assert suggestions == 1
assert snap suggestions ~ Source A
assert no-row unkept orchid-only sentinel
capture 09_reopen_A1_search
key enter
wait-saved-reader 600
assert snap saved-reader-state == Ready
assert snap saved-reader-text ~ Archive A1 opening
assert snap saved-reader-quote == naïve — 東京 🐦
assert snap saved-reader-origin ~ /A
assert a11y Open original address
capture 10_reopen_A1_reader
record-saved-sources 10_reopen_A1_reader
log R2 fresh-process offline reopen complete
